  * |                            |   |
  * |                            |   |---+
  * |                            |   |   |
  * |                            |   |   |
  * |                            |   |   |
  * |                            |   |   |
  * +----------------------------+   |   |
  *    |                             |   |
  *    +-----------------------------+   |
  *       |                              |
  *       +------------------------------+
  * </pre>
